    "headingPrefix": "Geospatial work",
    "headingHighlight": "that supports real decisions.",
    "paragraph": "I'm a Geomatics Engineering graduate from Tribhuvan University. I work with GIS, GNSS, drone surveying, photogrammetry, and 360° mapping to turn field data into maps and systems people can use. My work includes high-resolution mapping with Airlift Technology; high-altitude drone logistics, environmental reconnaissance, and terrain mapping at Mt. Manaslu; field capture and virtual tours with Galli Maps; drone-delivery and mapping support after the Rasuwa–Bhotekoshi flood with Airlift Technology and UN WFP; and WebGIS for municipal utilities. I combine fieldwork and spatial analysis to support disaster response, infrastructure, and mapping needs."
